&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;本社を東京都千代田区一ツ橋に移転&lt;/p&gt;
